  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180C.",
    "In a baking dish, drizzle olive oil and spread it thinly.",
    "Toss cod fillets with garlic, salt, pepper, and lemon zest, then lay them in the dish.",
    "Pour in white wine, water, and fermented jang, letting the liquid cover the fish.",
    "Scatter chopped tomato and onion over the cod.",
    "Cover the dish with foil and bake for 25 minutes until the cod flakes easily.",
    "Remove foil, stir in matcha powder until dissolved and the soup turns a gentle green hue.",
    "Let cool slightly, then blend on low until smooth, adding water if necessary for desired consistency.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with a sprinkle of extra matcha powder and a squeeze of lemon."
